# build.sh output that is not worth keeping; app.apk itself is committed so
# the platform capture can be re-run without an Android SDK. Variant APKs and
# the third-party jars they link are rebuilt from Maven artifacts listed in
# variants/*/lib (see build.sh); neither belongs in the repository.
/classes/
/dex/
/app-unsigned.apk
/app.apk.idsig
/out/
**/lib/*.jar
**/jni/
